DATA='Magnetic flux|fluxB=B*A*cos(th)|fluxB,B,A,th|ss+s|Uniform field; angle to area normal.|P:1,-A*B*cos(th);P:-A*cos(th),fluxB;P:-B*cos(th),fluxB;E:\nFaraday average emf|emf=-Nm*dflux/t|emf,Nm,dflux,t|s+s0|dflux per turn; fixed sign convention.|P:t,Nm*dflux;P:dflux,emf*t;P:Nm,emf*t;P:emf,Nm*dflux\nMotional emf|emf=B*l*v|emf,B,l,v|ss+s|Perpendicular rod, velocity and field.|P:1,-B*l*v;P:-l*v,emf;P:-B*v,emf;P:-B*l,emf\nSelf-induced emf|emf=-ind*cur/t|emf,ind,cur,t|s+s0|cur here is CHANGE in current over t.|P:t,cur*ind;P:cur,emf*t;P:ind,emf*t;P:emf,cur*ind\nInductor energy|U=ind*cur^2/2|U,ind,cur|s+s|Ideal inductor energy>=0.|P:2,-cur^2*ind;P:-cur^2,2*U;P:-ind,0,2*U\nSolenoid inductance|ind=mu0*Nm^2*A/l|ind,Nm,A,l|++++|Long air-core solenoid; ignore ends.|P:l,-A*Nm^2*mu0;P:-A*mu0,0,ind*l;P:-Nm^2*mu0,ind*l;P:ind,-A*Nm^2*mu0\nMagnetic energy density|ub=B^2/(2*mu0)|ub,B|0s|Vacuum.|P:2*mu0,-B^2;P:-1,0,2*mu0*ub\nRL time constant|tau=ind/res|tau,ind,res|0++|Equivalent series resistance.|P:res,-ind;P:-1,res*tau;P:tau,-ind\nRL current rise|cur=Vb/res*(1-exp(-res*t/ind))|cur,Vb,res,t,ind|ss+0+|Initially zero current; constant source.|P:res*exp(res*t/ind),-Vb*exp(res*t/ind) + Vb;P:1 - exp(res*t/ind),cur*res*exp(res*t/ind);E:;E:ind*ln(Vb/(Vb - cur*res))/res;E:res*t/ln(Vb/(Vb - cur*res))\nRL current decay|cur=cur0*exp(-res*t/ind)|cur,cur0,res,t,ind|ss+0+|Source-free series RL circuit.|P:exp(res*t/ind),-cur0;P:-1,cur*exp(res*t/ind);E:ind*ln(cur0/cur)/t;E:ind*ln(cur0/cur)/res;E:res*t/ln(cur0/cur)\nLC period|T=2*pi*sqrt(ind*C)|T,ind,C|0++|Ideal LC; no resistance.|P:1,-2*pi*sqrt(C*ind);E:(1/4)*T^2/(pi^2*C);E:(1/4)*T^2/(pi^2*ind)\nLC angular frequency|w^2=1/(ind*C)|w,ind,C|s++|Choose positive angular frequency.|P:C*ind,0,-1;P:C*w^2,-1;P:ind*w^2,-1\nLC peak current|cur^2=Q0^2/(ind*C)|cur,Q0,ind,C|ss++|Magnitude from total LC energy; choose positive peak.|P:C*ind,0,-Q0^2;P:-1,0,C*cur^2*ind;P:C*cur^2,-Q0^2;P:cur^2*ind,-Q0^2\nLC charge vs time|Q=Q0*cos(w*t+ph)|Q,Q0,w,t,ph|sss0s|Ideal LC; phase radians; current is dQ/dt.|P:1,-Q0*cos(ph + t*w);P:-cos(ph + t*w),Q;E:;E:;E:\nRotating coil emf|emf=Nm*B*A*w*sin(w*t+ph)|emf,Nm,B,A,w,t,ph|s+s+s0s|Uniform B; flux=Nm*B*A*cos(w*t+ph).|P:1,-A*B*Nm*w*sin(ph + t*w);P:-A*B*w*sin(ph + t*w),emf;P:-A*Nm*w*sin(ph + t*w),emf;P:-B*Nm*w*sin(ph + t*w),emf;E:;E:;E:'
